Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 伙计们 该回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright guys, put your toys away.{\r}
