Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你打偏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞄偏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're aiming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这才像样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,扔掉摩托艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dump the ski!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快 把它丢下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we need to lose weight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,飞起来 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,飞起来 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机没起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't getting up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有幸运戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离北京大约还有20英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are approximately 20 miles out of Beijing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不想问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I want to hear it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 油压怎么样了 - 显示错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but what's the oil pressure? - Faulty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那高度仪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! And the altimeter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.41,0:14:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信吗 卡在10000英尺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe it? Stuck at 10,000 ft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 液压器呢 - 什么液压器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hydraulics? - What hydraulics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你又多了个垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, you flew another piece of junk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等你有空 我们聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey can we talk when you're not too busy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid's amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 我也很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过你习惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just used up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让客户准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the client ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是要干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要抄近路回家了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you're taking a shortcut home, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,降落伞好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parachute good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parachute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要背降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you gonna parachute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们居然把降落许可时间改到了明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe they changed the landing party to tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不过没关系 他可以早点回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's OK, I'll get home a little earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,15秒准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,舱门打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opening the hatch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,阴阳 从大款安全到家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yang, get money bags home safely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when are you coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也许很快 也许不回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe soon, maybe never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也许换个工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe try a new life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你走了我戏弄谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then who am I supposed to pick on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会有人顶我缺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find another minority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阴阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,后会有期 大鳄鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later, alligator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,正宗的中式外卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's a real Chinese takeout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开快点 我想家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floor it, I'm homesick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱这首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this song!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas, my friend..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你不会真的要这么做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you ain't going through with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 瞧她多美 谁不想娶她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Course I am. Look at that girl, who wouldn't marry her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她对你不忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She cheated on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那叫 半不忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a half-cheat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是半真半假 你又没证据 传言不靠谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other side of her, half-truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不靠谱 我不想泼你冷水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murky. I hate to break this to you, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可你要是娶了她 就能开帽子专卖店了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your girlfriend over there has a world-class cheating gene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我真该一刀捅死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should stab you in the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前觉得你的心是黑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I used to think you had a black heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,岂止是黑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black is too colorful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 宝贝 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey babe! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 巴尼 - 嗨 莱西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey Barney! - Hey Lacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我 下次别把我的宝贝带走这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise next time not to keep my baby away so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我用良心保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他没良心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he had one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁在神游呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who's lost in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有笔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a pen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你有不带骷髅的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got anything that doesn't have skulls in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你别说 还真没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是爱因斯坦的狭义相对论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Einstein's theory of spatial relativity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它优化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have made it better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,信不信由你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,贡纳嗑上那些化学品之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before Gunner became chemically unbalanced,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是麻省理工的高材生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he went to MIT{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还是化学工程的硕士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and had a Master's degree in chemical engineering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到这家伙还有脑子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This idiot actually had a brain, can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那后来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他辍学当保安了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He quit to be a bouncer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候我喜欢上一个迪斯科舞厅的舞女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to get close to this girl and dance at this disco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 她最后竟然甩了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't believe she dumped you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,能出去聊聊吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we talk outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I put this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你就直说吧 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be straight up, honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不清这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure what I feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这种生活 不适合你 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This life... It's not for you, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,以前挺适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我加入团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me a chance to be one of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很敬佩你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you got my respect forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很敬佩你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you got my respect too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我想干完这个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to finish out the month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,然后去找我女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I wanna go meet up my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她是哪儿人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's she from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她 她是法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's, uh, she's French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个是在阿富汗认识的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not I met her at Afghanistan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个护士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was a nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很会照顾人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That comes in handy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对 她人特别好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You'd like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意为她做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she's the kind of person you'd wanna do things for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我干这一行就是因为收入高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I took this job because the money's great...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就能给她买她想要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I can afford to get whatever that she deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她就是我的另一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of those things that just feels right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,和她在一起的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you know when you could be with someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都不用说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't even have to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就能知道彼此心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already know what they're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你能理解吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever had that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你不会当我是逃兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to think that I'm deserting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, lissten...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我像你这么年轻的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had to do it all over again at your age,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd do what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.09,0:19:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,再进去喝两杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you freshen up that beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,巴尼·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barney Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.23,0:20:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,找我干嘛 教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want from me, Church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的记性不太好吧 巴尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too good on the memory category are you, Barney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你上次帮我干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a deal with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有言在先的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可结果呢 你毁了半个维兰纳岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you end up, blowing off half of Atlanta,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还把那个中情局特工打得满身窟窿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}punching holes and a Bowie knife through a fellow CIA agent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说他是个坏蛋 可这也太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if he was a dirtbag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不过最让我痛心的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what breaks my heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然从我这儿偷了5百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you stole 5 million dollars from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你干的这些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for all this male-patterned badness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把你丢进关塔那摩监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta put you in the deepest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,最深最黑暗的牢房里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}darkest hole in Gitmo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,永不见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sunlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可我没这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I kept you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道总有一天你要还这笔账的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I knew the day would come when you were gonna pay me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today is that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有一架中国飞机在噶扎克附近的山区被人击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese plane got shot down over the mountains near a hellhole called Gazak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, who shot it down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜猜看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机上的保险箱里有一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aboard that plane is a safe carrying something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用知道它是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't need to know about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西绝不能落到坏人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you need to know is you can't let it fall onto the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你赶在其他人之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're gonna get in there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,找到保险箱 把里面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna get the contents of that safe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,给我带回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna bring it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说小菜一碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be a walk in the park for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就两清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we're even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个以后再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那个保险箱非常高级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The safe in that plane is very high-tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,密码每隔120秒自动更换一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The access code changes every 120 seconds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果输入错误密码 它就会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you use the wrong code, it blows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以我们得让你 - 等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to get... - Wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们 你和谁一起工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We? Who's "we"? Who are you working with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就当做是某个公司吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just call our host The Corporation..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗 我会派一个负责处理这种情况的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright? They're sending along a pro,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.17,0:22:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你们一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who specializes in this type of situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她叫麦琪·张 - 女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Her name is Maggy Chan. - A woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.86,0:22:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一般叫这个名字的都是女人 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That usually goes along with the name Maggy, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.53,0:22:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她能照顾好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can handle herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我要说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let me be clear:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.97,0:22:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything happens to her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,手指头有肉刺 或者受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gets hanged there, she gets hurt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,或者被欺负了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she gets roughed up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.09,0:22:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只要她回来时和去之前有什么不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she doesn't come back in exactly the same condition she went in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你手下那帮混蛋就会从地球上消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and your little gang of psychotic mutts will never be seen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点 我可以保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that, I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个人不太会当保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't make a very good babysitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别小看自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.80,0:23:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你会成为一个称职的保姆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna make a very good babysitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.37,0:23:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,7点准时到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be there at 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.74,0:23:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是麦琪·张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I'm Maggy Chan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是巴尼·罗斯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Barney Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.24,0:23:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂跟你说过我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Church told you about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你非要跟着去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you wanna tag along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.65,0:24:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我是去帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help, not tag along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,摩托车不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice motorcycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那个地方很陌生 不知道会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we're going, as you know, we don't know what to expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是定做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it custom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你跟我们去是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a mistake, you coming along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.15,0:24:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,自己改装的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Build it yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对 自己改装的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I built it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在耍我吗 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you playing games with me, Maggy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.59,0:24:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会是在耍我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you playing games with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,教堂说了你的顾虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Church told me what you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我精通格斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm combat-proficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.63,0:24:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,用不着什么保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a babysitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.10,0:24:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们几点出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when do we leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,早上5点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}0500.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.61,0:24:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她讨厌你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She ain't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.86,0:25:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.33,0:25:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要是她出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know if something happens to her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.86,0:26:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,责任都是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's coming back on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不先问问我的意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever think to ask me for my opinion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我都跟你说了10遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you 10 times before,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有别的选择 除非你想蹲监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have a choice unless you don't mind going to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看来教堂吓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, church intimidated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.13,0:26:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,又是你那个水性杨花的女朋友吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the woman-you-can-never-fully-trust calling again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我会捅死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I will stab you one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.72,0:26:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝 对 我当然在想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, baby. Yeah, of course I'm thinking about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你 我还能想谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else is there to think about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.22,0:26:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你当过兵 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the army, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.10,0:26:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 当了3年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am. 3 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.59,0:26:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次在阿富汗的库纳尔省\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last tour was Afghanistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.60,0:26:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't like it anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.17,0:26:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个说来话长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来听听吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.91,0:26:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我学的是狙击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, uh, was trained as a sniper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.61,0:27:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想让我当教官 可我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and an instructor too but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,更想去战斗 去参加行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just really wanna mix it up, you know, the action bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.88,0:27:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次我们被困在一个该死的山谷里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One time, we were stuck out in this hellhole valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,30多个敌人从山上的房子里向我们开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 30 Taliban opened up from these houses in the hills above us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.89,0:27:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有8个人困在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got about 8 of us pinned down bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我呼叫炮火支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I called in for artillery support{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.59,0:27:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可是上尉不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, "no way", says the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.20,0:27:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想伤及当地居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't want to endanger the locals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只好分散开 有的躲进沟里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we scattered, some crawled through a ditch, some,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.24,0:27:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有的跳进干枯的河床 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through a dry riverbed and the rest bailed, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.41,0:27:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还困在杀伤区里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were still stuck in the killzone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.61,0:27:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们交战了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we battled for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.89,0:27:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大概3小时吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, 3 hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,最后终于来了一架阿帕奇直升机 掩护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And finally an apache gunship chopper showed up to provide air cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.22,0:27:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人打退了 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scattered the hajis but..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.09,0:27:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现四个战友死在沟里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The smoke clears and four of my squad are dead on the ditch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.35,0:27:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,两个死在河床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and two on the riverbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我当时很愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's bad, sick...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.83,0:28:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们死得多冤呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All dead for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 更让我受不了的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the most... screwed up thing of all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.21,0:28:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上我回到基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I got back to base that night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,发现他们把我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found out that they had shot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.44,0:28:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我收养的流浪狗给打死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stray dog that I adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.35,0:28:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官下令除掉基地里的所有动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander's order's to get rid of all animals on the base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.91,0:28:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好像我们这一天下来杀得还不够似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, think, we had enough damn shooting for one day, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.39,0:28:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为这样 我决定离开那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway.. I, figured it was time to move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.16,0:28:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,正巧他们在招人 我就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard these guys were looking for someone and here I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,应答器有反应了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that transponder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.78,0:28:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有 目标在西北方向15公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, apparently, 15 km northwest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.67,0:28:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, darling..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, darling..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.39,0:29:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a little busy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.39,0:29:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, let's move, wanna be outta here fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.22,0:29:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,越快越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sooner, the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.16,0:29:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比利小子 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Billy the Kid. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.53,0:29:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,今天靠你了 去选据点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's your lucky day, you get to take point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.43,0:29:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.28,0:29:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你当年能跑这么快吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when you could do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.89,0:29:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了 你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd run away if I needed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.06,0:29:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.06,0:29:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,往下看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.63,0:29:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,往下看 看见了吗 凭你这短腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look down.. You see what I see? Short legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.00,0:29:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我赌一千块你追不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand bucks, you can't catch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.53,0:29:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,去啊 闪电侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:29:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天没空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a little busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.79,0:30:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.24,0:30:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机残骸在山脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found the wreckage, spotted a hill, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.38,0:30:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 比利 给我们留点面子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down, Billy. You're making us look bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say again, over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.49,0:30:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别装傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.59,0:30:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 我会慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that, slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.67,0:30:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一些 在山另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest of the plane's over the hill, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work, Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这些人的运气不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like somebody had a bad day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.79,0:30:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, get to the right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.79,0:31:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一群饿狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piss off, you roamers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.36,0:31:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,比利 去上面找有利位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright Billy, you get a vantage point up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们手里有狼毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's fur in the hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,狼群来之前他们还没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy was alive 'til the wolves got to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.41,0:31:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.13,0:31:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是这儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,凯撒 你进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar! I need you in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.95,0:32:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓住这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caesar grab a hold of this thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好像有弹簧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's spring loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.45,0:32:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞 钩住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, hook it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我数到三 大家就拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now on the count of three let's pull it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.19,0:32:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.66,0:32:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.70,0:32:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拉不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't hold this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.63,0:32:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.67,0:32:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.77,0:32:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,出问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.58,0:32:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹的引爆器启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The explosive timer's triggered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.84,0:32:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.78,0:32:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,54秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}54 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.78,0:32:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在跑还来得及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we leave now, we'll make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,麦琪 别管它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggy, let it go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.28,0:32:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我能弄好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Maggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.69,0:32:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,她触发了引爆器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tripped the detonator, stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.57,0:33:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我快抓不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing my grip..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.37,0:33:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,挺住 不然她会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just, hold it..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out, Maggy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.74,0:33:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,幸亏有我在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky I was here..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.42,0:33:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just thinking that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.03,0:33:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 不过它真的很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, it's important I get this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 看来你也是个不要命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got guts, no common sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But guts. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了 任务完成 我们撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's alright, we got it, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.57,0:33:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你挺厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.79,0:33:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,比利 下来吧 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy. Come on down, we're outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.31,0:33:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那小妞真猛 还好我心脏够强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman is crazy, but I got a good pump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.42,0:33:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想知道里面装了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you curious about what's inside the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.08,0:33:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不想 我只希望教堂别再烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I just wanna get Church off our backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.58,0:33:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比利小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy the Kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.62,0:33:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:33:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.60,0:34:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.73,0:34:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.90,0:34:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.50,0:34:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.05,0:34:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 长官 我中了埋伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir, they were waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.78,0:34:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快把武器放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the weapons now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.42,0:34:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.83,0:34:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个坚强的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a strong soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.93,0:34:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看看他有多坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see how strong he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.66,0:34:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.84,0:34:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.35,0:34:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们别听他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do nothing he says!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.75,0:35:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.92,0:35:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should not speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.09,0:35:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.52,0:35:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一开火 他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I fire, his head,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.10,0:35:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我数到三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.06,0:35:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别交出武器 你们不用管我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give your weapons, you don't owe me anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.20,0:35:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.30,0:35:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的 他会杀了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this! They'll kill everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.73,0:35:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他会杀了比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.18,0:35:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.95,0:35:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真让人感动 这个是个明智的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm impressed. Very good use of intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.86,0:35:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都别动 我们很快就能完事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody stay calm, we'll be done soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就会走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we will be on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.83,0:35:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把它给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me that knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.74,0:36:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this symbol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.64,0:36:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like symbol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.08,0:36:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是山羊的标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the symbol of the goat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.59,0:36:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它是 魔鬼的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pet... of Satan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.56,0:36:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,据说是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.06,0:36:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们拿了属于我的盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a case that belongs to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.73,0:36:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.77,0:36:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 连命也是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Like your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.77,0:36:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,盒子丢了 不在他那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's lost. He doesn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.50,0:36:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次机会 把盒子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.07,0:36:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you will force me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.97,0:36:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To cut...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的心脏挖出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.11,0:36:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 你这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, you piece of shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.02,0:36:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.19,0:36:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.10,0:37:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.94,0:37:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talking to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把它捡起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.64,0:37:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.18,0:37:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己去捡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humiliate yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.18,0:37:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.42,0:37:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.89,0:37:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,把它捡起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now pick it up..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.92,0:37:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好好放到我手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hand it to me nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你会跟他一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you will get what he got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.29,0:37:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,捡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.37,0:37:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be alright, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.05,0:38:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,尊重是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respect is everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.78,0:38:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没有尊重 我们就是凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without respect, we're just people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.12,0:38:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,卑微的凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}common, shitty people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.46,0:38:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.83,0:38:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.60,0:38:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both fighting men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.84,0:38:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我尊重你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I respect that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.94,0:38:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,作为战士 不应该像羊一样被宰掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fighting men, they don't deserve to be killed like sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.51,0:38:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得学会尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respect, must be taught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在脸朝下 趴在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down with your face on the ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.41,0:39:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别想挑战我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't challenge me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.58,0:39:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.85,0:39:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你怕我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you afraid of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.05,0:39:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.42,0:39:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.09,0:39:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.72,0:39:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 别说话 比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm dying. - Don't talk, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.55,0:39:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把绳子解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut his hands loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.69,0:40:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有封信在 我口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letter, in my pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.46,0:40:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay kid, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.95,0:40:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.46,0:40:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.86,0:40:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,盒子里装了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was in the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.35,0:40:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一台电脑 存了矿山的蓝图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A computer blueprint of a mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.65,0:40:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,矿山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.90,0:41:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么矿山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.29,0:41:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯人在那座矿山里藏了5吨武器级别的钚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Russians stole nearly 5 tons of weapons grade Plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.93,0:41:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,冷战后那座矿废弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mine was abandoned after the Cold War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knows it's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.84,0:41:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝图上标明了那些原料的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blueprints show where the Plutonium is stored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.90,0:41:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想防止它落到坏人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop it before it gets in the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你们没成功 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess that didn't happen, did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.12,0:41:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为了造炸弹 杀了那孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kid died so that some dirtbag could make bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.86,0:41:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.27,0:41:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你更遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as sorry as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.44,0:41:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好好埋葬他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.51,0:41:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的苏菲娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Sophia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.91,0:41:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望除了想念你 我还能找到别的事情做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could find something different to do besides just missing you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.25,0:41:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可我找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.12,0:41:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,队员们都对我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The team's treating me good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.99,0:42:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相照应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got each other's backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.12,0:42:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 不管我发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want you to know that wherever I end up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.56,0:42:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我都希望你能好好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be wanting the very best for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.56,0:42:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果奇迹发生我还能回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if some miracle happens and I come back again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.70,0:42:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,希望 还能做你的爱人 爱你的比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope I'm still your man. Much love, Billy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.14,0:42:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it that one of us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.71,0:42:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当中最想活着最应该活下去的人却死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who wants to live the most, who deserves to live the most, dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.65,0:42:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,而那些本该死的人 却还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the ones that deserve to die, keep on living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.52,0:42:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,上天要告诉我们什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the message in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.72,0:42:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.33,0:42:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪他 找到他 宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track 'em, find 'em, kill 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.51,0:43:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,CJ1492 听到呼叫请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CJ 1492 come up, requesting response immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.51,0:43:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这个笨蛋是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Bozo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.01,0:43:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,CJ1492 这是安全频道 能听到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CJ 1492 this is a secure airwave, do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.51,0:43:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.61,0:43:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么花了这么长时间 巴尼·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taking so long, Barney Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.84,0:43:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这任务对你来说轻而易举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should have been a walk in the park for you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.15,0:43:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,盒子在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.12,0:43:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不在我手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.35,0:43:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过 你如果这次搞砸了 你们会有什么结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you what would happen to you mutts if you pulled this shit again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.06,0:43:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一个好人为了这个盒子牺牲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good man died trying to get that case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.83,0:43:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.03,0:43:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.03,0:43:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我真的感到很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, as a matter of fact, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.75,0:43:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那地方难免会发生这种事 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this sort of situation comes with the territory, wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇也是难免的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so is payback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.34,0:43:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 教堂 你是个只敢在幕后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Church, you're that kind of guy that pulls his strings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.94,0:44:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,操纵别人去干脏活的胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everyone else does your dirty work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.68,0:44:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你没胆量自己去干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you've never had the guts to do it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.80,0:44:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.28,0:44:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 我们碰到麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.38,0:44:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,挖掘速度越来越慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The digging has slowed down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.25,0:44:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好多人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many are dying,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.55,0:44:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都是累死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and exhausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.69,0:44:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他太累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.89,0:44:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还有人觉得累吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody else tired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.13,0:44:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,再找些工人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get more workers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.29,0:45:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,村里的男人已经全都抓来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already taken most of the men from the villages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.58,0:45:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就抓剩下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get all the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.61,0:45:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,女人 孩子 全都抓来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women, children, all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.16,0:45:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.53,0:45:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这下知道它在哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.72,0:45:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不错 不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.71,0:45:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我知道怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok... I know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.04,0:45:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 三天之内把原料全都运出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, I want the Plutonium all in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.25,0:45:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.48,0:45:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有个买家愿意以每公斤四百万收购\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have people, ready to pay four million a kilo, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.72,0:45:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,三天之内必须搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days. No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.42,0:45:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你很聪明 你想想看 只要六磅这种原料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, smart, imagine if six pounds of pure Plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.06,0:45:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就足以改变整个世界的格局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is powerful enough to change the balance of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.40,0:45:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那五吨原料可以干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So imagine what 5 tons would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.37,0:46:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很有意思吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.38,0:46:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有点不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.38,0:46:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.38,0:46:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,信号中止了 他们在地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The transmissions stopped. They are underground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.44,0:46:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那就在这儿r降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm putting it down right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.98,0:46:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 大家动作快点 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's hustle, hustle! We gotta move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.28,0:46:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas! Come on. Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.93,0:46:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你什么时候能把它修好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know what the hell you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.65,0:46:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,五分钟 耐心点 别老催我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes. Don't get your knickers in a twist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.92,0:46:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.74,0:46:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,又有一辆货车 可能是他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That transport truck, could be one of theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.24,0:46:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们过去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's check this place out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.38,0:47:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要用枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.82,0:47:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,用经典装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Classics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.69,0:47:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想用这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been dying to use these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.39,0:47:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要打出情报来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll beat the truth out of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.90,0:47:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,麦琪 告诉大家在车里等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggy, tell the guys to wait in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.73,0:47:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.68,0:47:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们都在 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're here. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.98,0:47:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,生意不错吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.67,0:47:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他个头有点大 - 那你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's slightly gigantic. - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.93,0:47:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我说说而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.85,0:48:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的个头的确很大 - 我就说嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's really gigantic. - I said that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.30,0:48:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这个好用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little bit of classics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.81,0:48:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,从他们身上打出情报来然后就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we beat some info out of these guys and get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.64,0:48:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我没意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds good to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.23,0:48:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,从那个矮子开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start with the midget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.94,0:48:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 伙计们 我用更简单的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, boys. I can get them to talk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.64,0:48:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with much less effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.35,0:48:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛 帮他们修脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do, give them a pedicure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.95,0:48:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这有点变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.39,0:48:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞 你把卡车发动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas, I need you to hotwire that truck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.17,0:48:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,回飞机上取点武器过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and go back to the plane and get the weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.63,0:48:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不叫那个奶酪头去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She get one of those if she sends you to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.01,0:48:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别发牢骚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop complaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.70,0:48:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我真该一拳砸开你的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have bashed one of these up on your skull-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.87,0:48:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,情况怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.87,0:48:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on, let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.57,0:48:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们自称是桑族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call themselves Sangs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.41,0:49:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人控制着山区东面的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they say they control everything east of the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.19,0:49:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,抢劫 绑架 暗杀 什么都干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robbery, kidnapping, assassinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.91,0:49:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就像雇佣兵一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basically a cartel for hire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.35,0:49:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你能听懂他们的语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know the language?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.53,0:49:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,简单 半听半猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, put it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.72,0:49:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它介于乌克兰语和保加利亚语之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cross between Ukraine and Bulgarian dialect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我很牛吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.06,0:49:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.83,0:49:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christmas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.67,0:49:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.49,0:49:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你吼什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you yelling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.33,0:49:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你给了我一个垃圾活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you gave me the shit job, that's why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.58,0:49:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来我一枪毙了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll shoot you in the face when I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.17,0:49:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.31,0:49:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在你60岁高龄的破飞机边上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 60-year old death-trap you call a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.77,0:49:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么花了这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taking you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.71,0:49:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,桥坏了 路标也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there's bridges out, signs missing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.63,0:49:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我在破土路上颠了7个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been driving in these damn roads for the last 7 hours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.72,0:49:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,牢骚发完了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You done complaining?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.43,0:49:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的慰问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the sympathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.10,0:50:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很诡异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.84,0:50:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,像家一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.95,0:50:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪这么诡异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figures...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.81,0:50:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.45,0:50:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是前苏联的军事基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it's an old Soviet army base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.22,0:50:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,八十年代冷战时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably used in the '80s,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.02,0:50:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,使用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cold War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.62,0:50:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当年他们一定是在这儿进行专门针对美国的军事演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They most likely staged maneuvers and practiced attacks against the US here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.89,0:50:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么是你不知道的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.14,0:50:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 我就喜欢老字号的披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, just what I need, 50-year old pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.98,0:50:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这儿过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll bed down here for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.61,0:51:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西难吃死了 你的怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This tastes like shit. How's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.19,0:51:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我做的通心粉味道错不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't complain about Rigatoni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.99,0:51:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要未雨绸缪 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dine ahead, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.54,0:51:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I have to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.37,0:51:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 如果你知道自己明天会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, what if you knew you were gonna die tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.24,0:51:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一顿会吃什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would your last meal be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.08,0:51:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只能选一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.15,0:51:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.15,0:51:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你会选麦片粥吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably cereal for you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.82,0:51:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,麦片粥有什么不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what the hell is wrong with cereal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.62,0:51:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,太没创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cliche.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.99,0:51:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以搞创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be original, you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.20,0:51:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有创造精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you were an original, broad-thinking man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没准能发明一种耳朵形状的麦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd probably come up with some special cereal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.52,0:51:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,取名叫耳麦 就跟你的耳朵一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like Eareal, you know, just like your ear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.76,0:51:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,把它们泡在牛奶里 这样你就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pour milk on those suckas and just lay it in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.82,0:51:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也听不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't wanna eat shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.16,0:51:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要声明 我听力很好 不比你差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, my hearing is 20/20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.74,0:51:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,巴尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.37,0:51:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我选甜甜圈这种垃圾食品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donuts and most food that kills you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.91,0:51:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太深奥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's deep, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.48,0:51:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 你这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.28,0:51:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.08,0:52:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我 会选香酥鸭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crispy aromatic duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.05,0:52:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,配上苏梅酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With plum sauce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.28,0:52:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,非常性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very sexy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.72,0:52:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,意大利菜也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I like Italian, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.10,0:52:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得意大利菜不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starting to think Italian's overrated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.16,0:52:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.11,0:52:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的瑞典菜是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My very Swedish dinner would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.54,0:52:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby seal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小海豹肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whale ass...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.67,0:52:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,和鲸鱼屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the summer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.94,0:52:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我一直很想尝尝中国菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bu I'd really die, for some Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.47,0:52:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就等着饿死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you're gonna starve to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.45,0:52:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 睡觉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.21,0:52:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 巴尼 我还没吃完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Barney, I'm not done eating man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.83,0:53:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能问你件事吗 - 行 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I ask you something? - Sure, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.66,0:53:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么看到我这么紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you so nervous around me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.17,0:53:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是紧张 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get nervous, Maggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.80,0:53:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.89,0:53:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢保持一点距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just like keeping a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.39,0:53:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你不想再认识新朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it because you don't want to know any more people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.42,0:53:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 跟我亲近的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say that bad things have happened to people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.09,0:53:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,容易遇到不好的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come in close to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.35,0:53:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这种心态可不好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a good way to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.65,0:53:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.09,0:53:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还在想那个死去的小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think about the young man who died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.71,0:53:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.97,0:54:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可你很少提起他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't talk about him much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.34,0:54:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是这样面对死亡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, 'cause it's how we deal with death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.80,0:54:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们改变不了 只能淡化它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't change what it is so we keep it light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.98,0:54:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,直到黑暗越来越近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until it's time to get dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.09,0:54:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们彻底吞没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we get pitch black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.48,0:54:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.23,0:54:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.23,0:54:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.46,0:54:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodnight, Maggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.30,0:54:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我对天发誓 他要是再打下去我就毙了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God, if he won't stop snoring I'm gonna shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.24,0:55:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,贡纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.84,0:55:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You riding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.12,0:55:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这个问题很蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's a stupid question,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.82,0:55:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你煮的咖啡还有多的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you have any more of that coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.89,0:55:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只够一个人喝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only makes one cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.95,0:55:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我猜也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what I figured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.63,0:55:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.44,0:55:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人说桑族人基本上都在这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy said that a congregation of Sangs are probably in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.23,0:55:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,集中在东面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentrated east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.17,0:55:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's where we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.00,0:55:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,10分钟后出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of here in 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.74,0:55:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快点 做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be ready, do what you got to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.55,0:55:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we got problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.87,0:55:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.87,0:55:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.67,0:56:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.81,0:56:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.15,0:56:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.64,0:56:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.64,0:56:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.69,0:56:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,省点弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.66,0:56:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.03,0:56:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm almost there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.67,0:56:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 那是枪声吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, are those shots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.50,0:56:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.57,0:56:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.57,0:56:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被桑族人包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sang's got us pinned down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.71,0:56:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,挺得住吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hold them off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.75,0:56:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有辆坦克也许行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe with a tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.94,0:56:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.96,0:56:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.02,0:56:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有辆坦克 走 走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got a tank. Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.19,0:57:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.42,0:57:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.98,0:57:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有一发 试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One left. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.28,0:57:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey who did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.32,0:57:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我 我没弹药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me, I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.67,0:57:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What just happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,附近好像有个狂人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody got a little carried away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.48,0:57:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.05,0:57:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪的人在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where're the shooters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.71,0:57:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 不过他要想杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but if they had wanted us dead,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.83,0:57:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.37,0:57:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,巴尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.39,0:58:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大家别慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't freak out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.37,0:58:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,世界真小 巴尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small world, huh, Barney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.71,0:58:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,布克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Booker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.94,0:58:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumor has it, you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.94,0:58:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我也听说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I heard that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.27,0:58:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how's life treating you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.54,0:58:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你一个人干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.54,0:58:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我一向单干 你应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fight solo, I thought you knew that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.47,0:58:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我听说过 可一直不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I heard but I didn't buy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.41,0:58:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在信了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well now you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.45,0:58:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的团队 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This your team? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.92,0:58:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,贡纳 托尔·罗德 强壮凯撒 还有麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner, Toll Road, Hale Caesar and Maggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,布克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Booker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.99,0:58:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是他们说的孤狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one people call the "Lone Wolf"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.03,0:58:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前很凶狠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been called that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.86,0:58:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在温柔多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have mellowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.77,0:59:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.74,0:59:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我还听有人说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard another rumor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.41,0:59:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你被一条眼镜王蛇咬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you were bitten by a King Cobra?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.81,0:59:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错 经过长达五天的痛苦挣扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I was. But after five days of agonizing pain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.95,0:59:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那条蛇死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cobra died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.72,0:59:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,布克 很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Booker, great to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.49,0:59:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么会来这种鸟不拉屎的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how'd you wind up in this godforsaken place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.68,0:59:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被桑族人伏击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we got ambushed by Sang{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.66,0:59:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在东边100公里的地方 他们杀了我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about a 100 km east of here, killed one of my men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.03,0:59:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个年轻人 - 啊 我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- a young kid. - Yeah, sorry to hear that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.92,0:59:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.05,0:59:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那些桑族人是最无耻的渣滓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sans are the lowest form of scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.91,0:59:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他们是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shooting them have been a good business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.76,0:59:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的头儿是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who the leader is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.03,0:59:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫维莱恩的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah a guy named Vilain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.83,0:59:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,维莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vilain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.23,0:59:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙完全控制着这个地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he pretty much controls everything in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.86,0:59:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们想活着出去 得找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need more men if you'd expect to get out alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.67,0:59:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you help out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.71,0:59:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 巴尼 我一个人干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Barney. I work alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.22,0:59:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.22,0:59:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今天谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for showing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.52,0:59:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.04,1:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 巴尼 前面有个村子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Barney, there's a village down the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.06,1:00:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那里都是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are good people,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.31,1:00:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们痛恨桑族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they hate the sangs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.90,1:00:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没准能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they can help out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.44,1:00:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.47,1:00:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,玩得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy hunting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.78,1:00:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.29,1:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.59,1:00:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,算你走运 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a matter of opinion, what did I miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.09,1:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在路上告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you all about it on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.88,1:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 把武器装上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on guys, unload these weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.26,1:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,今年圣诞好像来得特别晚呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like Christmas came way late this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.80,1:00:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I love you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.59,1:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴能再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.90,1:00:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,总算碰上个识货的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally. Somebody with class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.07,1:00:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这一定就是布克说的那个村子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got to be the town that Booker was talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.63,1:00:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以在这样的地方养老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could retire to a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.41,1:00:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,空气新鲜 没有压力 再养几个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean air, no stress, raise some kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.44,1:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 麦琪 我真的想在这种地方养老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Maggy, I could retire to a pace like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.65,1:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡说八道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so full of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.48,1:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out! out! out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们打得也太糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're missing us by a mile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.44,1:01:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.44,1:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.21,1:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们瞄准的地方最安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safest place is in front of their gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.88,1:01:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要开枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will shoot you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.32,1:01:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.82,1:01:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.65,1:01:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are here to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.79,1:01:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想帮你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.17,1:01:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是你们俩 在这儿也会有艳遇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even you two rejects could get lucky around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.44,1:01:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 我不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think? - I doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.31,1:01:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.88,1:01:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.51,1:01:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们是美国人 - 谁说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're American. - Since when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.95,1:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞典人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swedish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.09,1:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,印第安人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.05,1:01:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,中国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.35,1:02:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一群弱智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.25,1:02:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,说完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.72,1:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.79,1:02:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来解决桑族人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are here to take care of The Sangs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.73,1:02:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.10,1:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,进屋说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.64,1:02:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.65,1:02:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你们是来抓孩子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who we'd think you've come for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.08,1:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死也要保护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is who we will die for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.99,1:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始那些人跟我们说有好工作 工资很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, they told us there'd be good jobs, good money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.98,1:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人去了 去了就再没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some went, but nobody come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.15,1:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们又找了些人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come for more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.73,1:02:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说只要有新的人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say as soon as our men go to job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.80,1:02:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,之前那些人就能回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the others come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.20,1:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My husband goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.65,1:02:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,过了很长时间 一直没音讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a long time we hear nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.07,1:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,后来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.63,1:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,桑族人来村里把所有的男人都抓走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Sangs come and they take all of the rest of the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.20,1:03:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,逼他们在矿山里干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Force them to work in the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,隔壁村也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same in the next village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.81,1:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,附近村都是 他们抓走了我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the next, they take my sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.55,1:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就剩下这些小孩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all that is left, are the very young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那些家伙还会来抓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they will be back for them, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.11,1:03:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.77,1:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.79,1:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把孩子藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we hide them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.59,1:03:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等那些人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.87,1:03:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛不走呢 离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just move on? Leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.87,1:03:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.94,1:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死也不会离开这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our lives will be the last thing they'll take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.81,1:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么会来这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us why you're here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.73,1:03:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,找桑族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're tracking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.08,1:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.21,1:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我们吗 看看那些孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And help? You saw the children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.64,1:03:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,桑族人会回来杀光他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon they'll be damned and they'll kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.08,1:03:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也有账要和他们算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have our own business with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.60,1:03:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.38,1:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.60,1:03:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她们坚持不了多久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think they're gonna last here much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.29,1:04:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.08,1:04:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不做点什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're not gonna do anything about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.22,1:04:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.13,1:04:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,以你的性格一定会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with your ego I think you're gonna love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.25,1:04:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的性格 - 你的性格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My ego? - Your ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.91,1:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的什么性格 - 你很自恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you mean my ego? - You got a big ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.18,1:04:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你很自恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a big ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.83,1:04:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你才自恋呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check your ego out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.56,1:04:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 你这家伙简直自恋到极点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, your ego is like the size of a dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.30,1:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,自恋狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.13,1:04:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.31,1:04:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到钚原料了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found the Plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.23,1:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伊娃 桑族人来了 通知所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eva. The Sangs are coming! Warn everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.93,1:05:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,搜查所有房屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search all the houses!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.88,1:05:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,注意警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep on looking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.80,1:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lari! Lari!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.72,1:05:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿 神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show us where the kid is, priest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.63,1:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别多管闲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get out of our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.63,1:05:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我以上帝的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the power vested in me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.02,1:05:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,宣布你和这把刀永结同心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now pronounce you man and knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.65,1:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.91,1:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,下地狱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest in pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.01,1:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the last one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.01,1:07:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.18,1:07:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.37,1:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,仓库清空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chambers are cleared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.75,1:07:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不许留活口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now a good sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.15,1:07:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全都处理掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bury them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.30,1:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到十多个守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see about a dozen guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.60,1:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,轻武器 还有几把重型机枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Light weapons, couple of badass 50 cals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.59,1:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.02,1:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还有反坦克装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anti-tank devices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.20,1:08:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的卡车根本冲不进矿区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way our trucks will get through that minefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.77,1:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这问题很傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know this is a stupid question,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.78,1:08:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么不是送死的计划吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you got any ideas so we won't get killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.61,1:08:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是有几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a few I'm thinking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.94,1:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,炸开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.29,1:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,炸开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.82,1:09:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target in sight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.76,1:09:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby wants to travel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.42,1:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 够刺激吧 - 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rock and roll! - Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.49,1:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,投弹完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombs away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.73,1:09:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tighten up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.12,1:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,现在什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening now?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.12,1:09:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.11,1:09:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会是要真的要这么干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not doing what I think you're doing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.40,1:09:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.11,1:09:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.26,1:09:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.55,1:10:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你得换架飞机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need a new plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.42,1:10:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快就能回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be home soon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.82,1:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们来晚了 - 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We are too late! - What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.56,1:10:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,原料运走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Plutonium is gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.30,1:10:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要爆炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To explode!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.36,1:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快 快离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.99,1:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快 快 - 快走 大家快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, go, go. - Move it, move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.70,1:10:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.79,1:11:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,得在这儿待一会儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be here a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.71,1:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't seem right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.92,1:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到结局是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going out this chickenshit way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.38,1:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.16,1:11:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 还没完呢 伙计们 我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't over yet, kids. I got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.15,1:11:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,磷酸盐岩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phosphate rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.01,1:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他要干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.94,1:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是想做炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably making a bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.03,1:11:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.72,1:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你问他啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.59,1:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you doing, Gunner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在做炸弹 有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm making a bomb. You mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.96,1:11:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有文化的疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A maniac with brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.35,1:12:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.35,1:12:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,磷酸盐岩 密度是1.852\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phosphate rock, got a density of 1.52,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.61,1:12:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,熔点是摄氏44.2度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}melting point 44.2 centigrade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.88,1:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 给我点火药 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! I want some gunpowder, fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.69,1:12:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,给他 人家可是学化学工程的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it! The man's a chemical engineer, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.86,1:12:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还是富布莱特学者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a full-pledged scholar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.86,1:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,倒进管子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pour it in the pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.03,1:12:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这大个子没准开窍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big man might be onto something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.20,1:12:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 也许不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think? - Probably not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.28,1:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,估计没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.65,1:12:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这么慢 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need some help with that, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.34,1:12:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 把自己炸了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, blow yourself up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.40,1:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,打火机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.29,1:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,用完还我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.60,1:12:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都后退 声音会很响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better get back! This is gonna be loud!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.21,1:12:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,都后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.96,1:12:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, alright, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.46,1:12:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.23,1:12:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不想把脑袋炸了 就退远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better turn around unless you want your heads blown up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.28,1:12:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把耳朵堵上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better cover your ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.97,1:12:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.81,1:13:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,岩石一定是受潮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the phosphate's must've been damp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.54,1:13:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.60,1:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是你脑子受潮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.66,1:13:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.46,1:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别哭 贡纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't cry, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.71,1:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你敢想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost had an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.45,1:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.19,1:13:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 战壕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing, Trench?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.22,1:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 太谢谢你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.76,1:13:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.32,1:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扯平了 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're even now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.67,1:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.67,1:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见 战壕 多谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be seeing you around, Trench. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.35,1:14:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别急 还没结束呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, it's not over yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.13,1:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.13,1:14:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.37,1:14:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing, pal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.43,1:14:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我挺好的 教堂 你到这儿来干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good, church, what're you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.00,1:14:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,听说这儿有个聚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard there's a party in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我的聚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's my party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.98,1:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直这么自私吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he always been this selfish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.26,1:14:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.28,1:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.76,1:14:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你想不想干掉那个维莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna kick Vilain's ass or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.47,1:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,带上你那些兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget the little rascal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.59,1:15:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.87,1:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让其他车直接开到飞机库里 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the rest of the nukes to the hangar, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.28,1:16:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把原料都装上飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get the Plutonium on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.56,1:16:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.16,1:16:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要争取时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to buy some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.68,1:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.85,1:17:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.23,1:17:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them up. Go... move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.16,1:17:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.. go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.62,1:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好玩吧 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fun, huh? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.12,1:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 他在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.33,1:18:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,老大 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.43,1:18:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.43,1:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把他撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tear him apart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.01,1:18:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我快没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm almost out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.37,1:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.65,1:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么每次都是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been back enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.39,1:18:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.45,1:18:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yippee-ki-yay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.43,1:18:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁会来 兰博吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's next? Rambo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.69,1:19:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.02,1:19:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.21,1:19:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.04,1:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,发动引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.19,1:19:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,马上起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this thing in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去赚钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to make some money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.59,1:19:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.39,1:19:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,战壕 快上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trench! Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.43,1:19:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋都比这车大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My shoe is bigger than this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.51,1:19:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.33,1:20:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.38,1:20:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,准备直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start the helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.70,1:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有位特殊客人要来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a special guest coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.55,1:20:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.22,1:20:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.18,1:21:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.48,1:22:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,经典就是经典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't beat the Classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.65,1:22:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,巴尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barney!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.66,1:22:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这儿干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.75,1:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm going there alone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.26,1:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事都别进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't follow me no matter what, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.25,1:22:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.54,1:22:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.25,1:22:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果门开了 出来的不是我 而是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that door opens up and I don't come out, and he does,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.07,1:22:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.76,1:22:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来点戏剧性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make it more dramatic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.10,1:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.44,1:23:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没子弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out of bullets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.57,1:23:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.01,1:23:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.75,1:23:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想杀人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna kill me like a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.22,1:23:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还是想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you wanna kill me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.39,1:23:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,宰羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a sheep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.82,1:23:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是把好刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.32,1:24:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.32,1:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你选哪个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it going to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.91,1:24:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人还是宰羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man or sheep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.65,1:24:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你想单挑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna man up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.12,1:24:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我来陪你玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll man you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.66,1:24:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很想折磨我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must want to hurt me bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.13,1:24:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会折磨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.94,1:24:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要你命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.57,1:24:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.40,1:25:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over so soon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.30,1:25:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的本还没回来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my money's worth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.97,1:25:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.93,1:25:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming right up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.19,1:25:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,味道好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tastes good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.29,1:25:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talking to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.27,1:25:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该收场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to wrap this up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.46,1:26:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太讽刺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.03,1:26:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.50,1:26:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而我 拿着你的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.30,1:26:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.54,1:26:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像杀他一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.14,1:26:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.91,1:26:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们叫他什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you call him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.88,1:26:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.05,1:26:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 维莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Vilain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.25,1:26:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不怕你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 维莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Vilain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.56,1:26:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 维莱恩 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Vilain! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.32,1:27:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,起来 维莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Berdiri Vilain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.03,1:27:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,给我 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get... up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,现在转过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.97,1:27:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来 小羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around, sheep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.65,1:27:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what!?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.80,1:28:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字叫比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.44,1:28:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你会切火鸡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We oughta go to Turkey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.14,1:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you win?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.44,1:28:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.28,1:28:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, where's the proof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.48,1:28:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小心碰头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.35,1:28:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.09,1:28:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,干得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a nice touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.69,1:28:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有点过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little extreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.53,1:28:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不过挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.54,1:29:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不想提这事 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As much as I hate to say this, Bam-Bam,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.87,1:29:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过既然你们拿回了原料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now that we got control of the Plutonium,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.98,1:29:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扯平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that makes us even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.34,1:29:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.75,1:29:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,麦琪 你跟我们一起回去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Maggy you'll be coming with us, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.48,1:29:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.43,1:29:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I just want..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.34,1:29:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有点孩子气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're OK, just a little immature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.82,1:29:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不一定要走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.07,1:29:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你希望我留下 我就留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want me to stay, I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.39,1:29:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了我还救了你这个保姆一命呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did save a babysitter's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.89,1:29:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you did do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.66,1:29:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你带来好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm good luck for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.86,1:29:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可我会给你带来厄运 我不想这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can be bad luck for you and I can't allow that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.17,1:30:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果需要帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever want help,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.04,1:30:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来找我 不然你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}call me. Or you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.44,1:30:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.52,1:30:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.12,1:30:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊 你把活都干完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving on, you killed all my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.66,1:30:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一匹孤狼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were the "Lone Wolf".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.30,1:30:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,和狼群在一起也挺有意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes it's fun to run with the pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.60,1:30:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这话说得对 保重 麦琪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a point. You take care, Maggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.54,1:30:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我差点忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I almost forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.40,1:30:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为了感谢你们 我的野蛮朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a token of my gratitude, my violent friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.09,1:30:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你们一个回家的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, and the little rascals a ride home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.06,1:30:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.76,1:30:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.23,1:30:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是礼物吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.86,1:31:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,老得都能进博物馆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing belongs in a museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.56,1:31:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.67,1:31:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 好玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Fun, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.87,1:31:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对 很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.41,1:31:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.51,1:32:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 小心 步步为营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care. Beware beware, what we care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.91,1:32:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要掉以轻心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Care for what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老天没准会要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or mumbo jumbo's gonna hoodoo you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.28,1:32:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,老天没准会要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mumbo jumbo's gonna hoodoo you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.16,1:32:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,轰隆 轰隆 轰隆 轰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boomalay boomalay boomalay boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.51,1:32:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,敬比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.67,1:32:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,敬比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.78,1:32:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,敬比利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.54,1:32:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,愿他安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.41,1:32:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做个按摩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a massage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.98,1:32:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.50,1:32:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.17,1:32:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.91,1:32:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有人托我捎句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From one friend to another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.04,1:32:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.91,1:32:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你得好好学学怎么打架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really should learn how to fight.{\r}
